          <string>&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
&lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:12pt; font-weight:600; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:11pt; color:#a40000;&quot;&gt;This exam is an INDIVIDUAL ASSIGNMENT !!!    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:11pt; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;The goal is for your code to behave the same as the provided sample solution (while conforming to specified constraints).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:11pt; color:#a40000;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:6pt; color:#a40000;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; color:#cc0000;&quot;&gt;==&amp;gt; You may use hand-written &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Qt4-style&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; color:#cc0000;&quot;&gt; or &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Qt5-style&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.Lucida Grande UI'; color:#cc0000;&quot;&gt; connect statements on any exam problem &amp;lt;==&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:6pt; font-weight:400;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt;All problems share a common &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:11pt; color:#0617f3;&quot;&gt;QGraphicsScene&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt; object named &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:11pt; color:#a40000;&quot;&gt;scene&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt;Each problem tab displays a different &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:11pt; color:#0617f3;&quot;&gt;QGraphicsView&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt; objects - one object per problem, but all views display data from the same &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:11pt; color:#0617f3;&quot;&gt;QGraphicsScene&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt; object named &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:11pt; color:#a40000;&quot;&gt;scene&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt;- The origin of the scene object falls in the middle of each displayed scene.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt;- The tick marks are spaced 100 pixels apart along the perimeter of each scene.  Each scene is 400 pixels x 600 pixels &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt;- &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:11pt; color:#a40000;&quot;&gt;DO NOT ALTER THE PROVIDED FORM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt;- &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:11pt; color:#a40000;&quot;&gt;DO NOT REDRAW THE PROVIDED FORM -- USE THE FORM AS PROVIDED&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:6pt;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:11pt; text-decoration: underline; color:#a40000;&quot;&gt;Step-by-step directions for each problem&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:11pt; color:#a40000;&quot;&gt; appear within the labeled problem tab&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt;-  You may work the problems in any order.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt;-  You may submit as many times as you want.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt;-  I will grade your last submission since it should be the most complete and correct version of your code.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:6pt;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:11pt; text-decoration: underline; color:#a40000;&quot;&gt;Submission Directions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt;-  Access &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:11pt; color:#a40000;&quot;&gt;Exam2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt; within Canvas&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt;-  For &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:11pt; color:#0617f3;&quot;&gt;problem #1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt;, attach  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:11pt; color:#a40000;&quot;&gt;dialog.h&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt;-  For&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:11pt; color:#0617f3;&quot;&gt; problem #2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt;, attach  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:11pt; color:#a40000;&quot;&gt;dialog.cpp&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt;-  To complete your submission in Canvas, hit the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:11pt; color:#a40000;&quot;&gt;Submit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Cantarell'; font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt; button&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
